#: ../doc/export.rst:21
msgid "Export"
msgstr "Exporteren"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/export.rst:23
msgid ""
"Exporting converts your OpenShot project (clips, effects, animations, "
"titles) into a single video output file (using a process called ``video "
"encoding``). By using the default settings, the exported video will be "
"compatible with most media players (such as VLC) and websites (such as "
"YouTube, Vimeo, Facebook) and creates a ``MP4 (h.264 + AAC)`` formatted "
"video file. See :ref:`profiles_mp4_h264_ref`."
msgstr ""
"Exporteren zet je OpenShot-project (clips, effecten, animaties, titels) om "
"in één enkele video-uitvoerbestand (met een proces genaamd ``video-"
"encoding``). Door de standaardinstellingen te gebruiken, is de geëxporteerde"
" video compatibel met de meeste mediaspelers (zoals VLC) en websites (zoals "
"YouTube, Vimeo, Facebook) en wordt een video in ``MP4 (h.264 + AAC)`` "
"formaat gemaakt. Zie :ref:`profiles_mp4_h264_ref`."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../doc/export.rst:28
msgid ""
"Click on the :guilabel:`Export Video` icon at the top of the screen (or use "
"the :guilabel:`File→Export Video` menu). The default values will work fine, "
"so just click the :guilabel:`Export Video` button to render your new video. "
"You can also create your own custom export profiles, see "
":ref:`profiles_ref`."
msgstr ""
"Klik op het :guilabel:`Export Video`-pictogram bovenaan het scherm (of "
"gebruik het menu :guilabel:`Bestand→Export Video`). De standaardwaarden "
"werken prima, dus klik gewoon op de knop :guilabel:`Export Video` om je "
"nieuwe video te renderen. Je kunt ook je eigen aangepaste exportprofielen "
"maken, zie :ref:`profiles_ref`."

